/* cockpit.ini. The unsuffixed keys are single-player's; the _0 / _1 pairs
   are the split screen's two halves. Each is the top-left of a 128x128
   quad drawn 1:1 -- which is what makes the negative Y right rather than
   wrong: place1..6 and lap carry 30-odd px of transparent margin above
   their word art, so the badge's INK lands on screen with the quad's own
   top edge above it. */
